 183: > account type."
 184: 
 185: Verified: the two iterations differ only in the email label; neither completes signup as a type
 186: nor asserts one, so the parameterization gate-1 finding 8 required is nominal.
 187: 
 188: **Remedy:** each iteration completes signup as its type after verification â€” NGO with
 189: organization and acknowledgment, volunteer with linked GitHub identity and acknowledgment â€” and
 190: asserts the account row carries that global type, so a type-specific verification regression
 191: fails the body.
 192: 
 193: ### S2-5 â€” ACCEPT, CONVERGED with flash F3 (high, _integration.ts:469)
